        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Before performing any action, verify that BusinessUnit__c = &apos;Net&apos; OR Segment = &apos;Residencial&apos; for the current service case.

If not, do not retrieve any data and respond that this agent only supports Residential (Net) cases.</description>
