        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If there are no customer interactions regarding changes, no recorded cases related to changes, and the user&apos;s profile is exactly &quot;Atendimento Call Center&quot; or &quot;Atendimento Call Center Madrugada,&quot; inform the user to follow the escalation process.</description>
