        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Do not process or retrieve service history for segments other than Net/Residencial. Do not expose CPF, RG, active date, or any contact PII. Do not retrieve data for accounts or contracts not linked to the current active service case. Do not process cases whose client ID does not start with &apos;001&apos;. Do not include cases unrelated to the NBA record types: Claro_NBA_Retention, Claro_NBA_Profitability, Claro_NBA_Inbound_Rentab, Claro_NBA_Outbound_Rentab.</description>
